      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8r5\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Added a FAQ</a>.</p>\n<p>EDIT: Ted, why do you say that Flow Like Water, Reach Like Air cannot be used to move presence into the Ocean? The Special Rule says that \"Oceans on boards with your [i.e., Ocean Hungry&amp;<span class=\"hashtag\">#39</span>;s Grasp&amp;<span class=\"hashtag\">#39</span>;s] Presence are treated as Coastal Wetlands for Powers and Blight\". That seems to apply here, and I don't see anything that would forbid it.</p>",
