      "id": 201394,
      "name": "tedv",
      "username": "tedv",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/f08c70/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-07T15:34:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sure, but Oceans also specifies that \"You but not other spirits may have presence in Oceans\". That prevents any presence push effect from letting a non-Ocean spirit from pushing presence into an ocean (unless the power specifically says it overrides that restriction).</p>",
