      "id": 201397,
      "name": "Eric R",
      "username": "Eric_R",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-07T17:16:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With the special rule worded as it is, yes, Powers, should be able to add/move other Spirits' Presence into the ocean. That's pretty clear. (Though because it's a late rewording, it's also not a case I'd considered much, nor which came up in testing to my knowledge.)</p><p>Unlike most other things getting stuck in the ocean, other Spirits' Presence raises some weird follow-on questions... particularly if Ocean loses all Presence on that board. I'll think on those.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
