      "raw": "<p>With the special rule worded as it is, yes, Powers, should be able to add/move other Spirits&#39; Presence into the ocean. That&#39;s pretty clear. (Though because it&#39;s a late rewording, it&#39;s also not a case I&#39;d considered much, nor which came up in testing to my knowledge.)</p><p>Unlike most other things getting stuck in the ocean, other Spirits&#39; Presence raises some weird follow-on questions... particularly if Ocean loses all Presence on that board. I&#39;ll think on those.</p>",
